scripts/node_modules/
# Issue tracking document (contains implementation instructions)
somzilla.md

# There is no root package.json — node projects live in frontend/ and
# scripts/, each with their own lockfile. A root-level lockfile is a sign
# `npm install` was run by accident at the repo root.
/package-lock.json

# Accidental local `cargo check ... > file.txt` / `2> file.txt` redirects
# under stellar-swipe/ that sometimes get committed by mistake.
stellar-swipe/compile_errors.txt
stellar-swipe/shared_errors.txt